<title>UK: Russia Credit sets 100 mln mark May 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Russia Credit sets 100 mln mark May 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RUSSIA CREDIT LTD SERIES 3 CAYMAN ISLANDS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    18.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.98     PAY DATE  S-16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    99.98     SPREAD	+318 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE     SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND TOBL APRIL 1999</p>
<p> NOTES	SECURED AGAINST A DEPOSIT OF $65.4 MILLION AND A</p>
<p>		SWAP AGREEMENT WITH THE LEAD. </p>
<p> NOTES	UNDERLYING $65.4 MLN SECURITIES ARE RUSSIAN MINFINS</p>
<p>		SERIES THREE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
